WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:25.400


00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:33.000
♪The clouds hide the faint light
behind them♪

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:37.780
♪A lonely bench on the street corner♪

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:42.120
♪Where all feelings come to rest♪

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.739
♪In the night sky, the moon's trail♪

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:51.629
♪Stitches up and soothes my sorrow♪

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:54.599
♪The courage to get close to you♪

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:58.490
♪Drives away my hesitation♪

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.169
♪Fate turns and brings us together♪

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:03.189
♪I search my memories with all my might♪

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:05.890
♪Love catches me off guard♪

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.219
♪You, in the album♪

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:12.419
♪Shine through my past like starlight♪

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.979
I'll go dry my hair.

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:14.820
Okay.

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:17.649
Maybe...

00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:21.770
♪Melting all my fears away♪

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:24.220
I can help you.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.840
♪I'm lost in them♪

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:33.649
♪The world suddenly has meaning♪

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:38.190
♪Through the pouring rain, I found you♪

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:40.379
♪In the space of our embrace♪

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:44.730
♪Stars spill across the sky♪

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:03.729
♪In the night sky, the moon's trail♪

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:07.589
♪Stitches up and soothes my sorrow♪

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:10.559
♪The courage to get close to you♪

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:14.450
♪Drives away my hesitation♪

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:17.129
♪Fate turns and brings us together♪

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:19.149
♪I search my memories with all my might♪

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:21.850
♪Love catches me off guard♪

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.179
♪You, in the album♪

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:29.079
♪Shine through my past like starlight♪

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:32.319
=Echoes of Gang City=

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:37.960
=Episode 18=
(Sharing a Bed Is Not Enough)

00:02:45.053 --> 00:02:46.100
I...

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.620
I like...

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:51.860
I... I'm used to sleeping on the left.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.940
Alright. I'll sleep on the right.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:07.340
Good night.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:06.180
Good night.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:12.059
♪Tonight the rain falls soft and slow♪

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.180
Good night.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:20.720
♪Blending with letters left unread
drifting through the air♪

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:26.800
♪You turn and look back at me♪

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:33.440
♪In those same eyes familiar tears
quietly appear♪

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:39.920
♪It feels like we have carried so much♪

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:46.680
♪So many questions time itself
could not make clear♪

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:53.120
♪The moment you walked into my life♪

00:04:54.280 --> 00:05:00.080
♪Every dream I had became something
I want with you near♪

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:08.580
We've cut off Minghui's core suppliers.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.980
Any reaction from Shen Gu?

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:15.980
Nothing so far.

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.339
He's just picking Xu Wanxin up
and dropping her off at work

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.900
like a live-in husband.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:23.979
Their raw material supply
has been cut off now.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.780
They'll last three months top.

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.420
Given Minghui's strength,

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:31.020
they'll find new suppliers
sooner or later.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:33.220
Keep the pressure on Minghui,

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.139
or stop now...

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.660
If we stop now,

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.780
everything we've done goes to waste.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.980
If Shen Gu won't move,

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.780
hit his weak spot.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:50.900
After all, Xu Wanxin
is his wife in name.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.420
Use Raymond Group's
platform and media system.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.980
I want Xu Wanxin to wake up tomorrow

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:00.980
and find her reputation ruined.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:21.860
Grandfather.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:23.299
Grandfather.

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:25.660
Did you sleep well last night?

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.620
Grandfather,

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:29.460
I'm heading to work.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:38.020
Can't bear to leave me?

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:40.979
Hurry along.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:43.020
The company needs you.

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:43.940
Okay.

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:58.339
Grandfather,

00:06:58.340 --> 00:06:59.699
we'll come back often.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:00.499
Alright.

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:01.700
I'll get going too.

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:10.059
Morning, Ms. Wanxin.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:10.980
Morning.

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:13.859
Ms. Wanxin, Ms. Xu's here.

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:15.420
She's waiting in the meeting room.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:16.259
Xi?

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.220
Yes.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:18.500
What's going on?

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:19.900
I have no idea.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.730
Okay. Got it. You may go.

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:25.299
Ms. Wanxin, good morning.

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.139
Morning.

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:27.260
Ms. Wanxin.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:31.780
Xi.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:36.060
What's wrong? Missed me?

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:40.460
What has happened?

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:42.420
What's with that face?

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:44.420
Gossip from last night.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.300
It spreads insanely fast.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:49.739
Today,

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:53.859
we're breaking down Gang City's
biggest scandal among the rich families,

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:56.080
(Shocking Financial Exposé)
the breakup of the Shen and Xu families.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.099
Fill me in.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:59.459
I'm totally lost.

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:04.020
Marriages between the rich
are capital reshuffling games.

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:30.380
Sorry to interrupt.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:31.900
Look at this.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:36.659
Xu Wanxin's father just passed away,

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:40.939
and right after that, she dumped Shen Hao,
the heir of Junlin Group,

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:43.459
and married his rival, Shen Gu,

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.659
who is currently
the largest shareholder of Junlin Group.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.820
Their relationship is complicated.

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:52.419
What's crazier is
that she changed her husband

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:55.099
in just three days.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.779
Right after that,
she announced cooperation

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.459
with Qingniao Group.

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:01.859
What kind of relationship is that

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:04.939
for Qingniao Group
to support Minghui Group?

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.460
Celebrities always
want to marry into wealth.

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:10.499
Miss Xu wants to climb higher too.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.539
Of course she'd find a stronger backer.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:16.140
That's disgusting.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.540
I'm taking them to court.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.859
They're not just trying to destroy
your marriage with Wanxin,

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:27.580
but they also want to shake
Minghui's credibility.

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:28.939
Look at the spread.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:31.259
Twelve major platforms
are pushing it at once.

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:34.060
Over 100 million views in 24 hours.

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:38.780
Shen Tingyuan really
went all in this time.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:41.500
Are they insane?

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:45.099
Boss, the trace is back.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.100
The source is media
under the Raymond Group.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:50.260
No wonder they bypassed
our monitoring system.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.860
Raymond missed out on you before,

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:56.180
and now we've taken their market.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.819
They have certainly been trying

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.380
to suppress us.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:02.300
Yes.

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:05.580
We've confirmed cooperation
between Raymond Group and Shen Tingyuan.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:11.980
Shen Gu,

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.020
they're starting

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.540
to suspect your identity.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.300
What are you going to do?

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.860
I'll make my identity public.

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.980
This is between me, Shen Tingyuan,
and Leng Meng.

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:51.980
It mustn't affect Minghui and Wanxin.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:53.980
That's my bottom line.

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:58.660
Are you sure?

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.700
Once you reveal your identity,

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:03.900
Qingniao's overseas servers could crash.

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:07.820
Your biometric data
will go public instantly.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.860
My identity was going to be exposed
sooner or later.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.580
Better to do it now

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.020
and let them come at me.

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:20.020
Don't worry.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:23.980
Miss Xu wants to climb higher too...

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:29.260
What a twisted narrative.

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:33.939
They're using facts
of marriage and business decisions

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.820
and twisting them into a conspiracy.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.859
They used to smear Shen Gu,
now they're targeting you.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.660
They won't let this go.

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:45.100
Xi, what are the trending keywords

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.820
about Shen Gu and me right now?

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.699
They're saying you're ungrateful,

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.100
morally questionable,

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:54.900
that your marriage to Shen Gu is fake,

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:57.260
and that you have an affair
with Qingniao's chairman.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:02.339
I've prepared a clarification statement.

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.339
Don't worry. If the rumors continue,

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.259
legal action will follow immediately.

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:07.380
Anjie,

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.420
draft the statement now.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.339
Yes.

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:11.380
Anjie.

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:14.180
If we clarify on our own,

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.900
it might not have the desired effect.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:20.780
We're in deep cooperation
with Qingniao.

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:22.300
Why don't we issue a joint statement?

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:24.700
That would not only limit the damage

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:28.300
but also reinforce the public perception
of our strategic alliance.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.580
What do you think?

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:31.460
That makes sense.

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:34.580
I'll make a call.

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:44.620
(Miss Xu)
Boss, it's Miss Xu.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:50.580
Hello, Miss Xu?

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:51.739
Sorry.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.139
My situation

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:55.060
has caused trouble for your side.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.380
I'd like to invite Qingniao Group

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.459
to issue a joint statement with me.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.580
Of course,

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.660
I'll personally step forward to clarify.

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:05.100
Wanxin, it's me.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:11.380
Shen Gu?

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:15.780
Why are you with Qingniao?

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.460
Listen to me, Wanxin.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:18.620
Don't worry.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.700
I'll handle the rumors.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.580
I'm the founder of Qingniao Group

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:05.380
and chief architect, Shen Gu.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:09.779
Regarding recent rumors
about Minghui Group and Qingniao Group,

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:13.059
please allow me to clarify everything

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:14.580
as Xu Wanxin's husband.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:30.760
(Interview with Mr. Shen Gu,
Founder of Qingniao Group)

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:59.880
♪Tonight the rain falls soft and slow♪

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:06.960
♪Blending with letters left unread
drifting through the air♪

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:13.040
♪You turn and look back at me♪

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:19.680
♪In those same eyes familiar tears
quietly appear♪

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:26.160
♪It feels like we have carried so much♪

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:32.920
♪So many questions time itself
could not make clear♪

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:39.360
♪The moment you walked into my life♪

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:46.320
♪Every dream I had became something
I want with you near♪

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:53.680
♪How many letters have I written
just for you?♪

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:59.480
♪If only you could truly hear
what my heart is trying to say♪

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:06.519
♪From this life on
no distance could keep us apart♪

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.399
♪The promise we made♪

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:13.079
♪Will find its way to be fulfilled
one day♪

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:19.679
♪But I want more
than just that fleeting gaze♪

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:26.080
♪Still I have not heard your answer♪

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:32.799
♪Can we still rewrite the ending
we face?♪

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:37.920
♪When regrets begin to turn around you
will hear it all♪

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:41.400
♪Everything that leads me back to you♪